    <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;Congratulations! You found my secret page! (I'm guessing you found it by reading the code. :) )&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;My research supervisor, Ludmila Eduardovna Gonchar, told me not to add cats to this project (and I suspect she'd say the same about my photo), so I decided to hide them here as an Easter egg.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;Anyway, I'm going to show her this page.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
